#: js/bioland.help-comments.js
msgid "Help"
msgstr "Ede"

#: js/bioland.help-comments.js
msgid "This will be the main content of your new site content.  The summary can be used to display a brief concise description of your content.  Further, the summary  will be displayed in list and card views of your record on the website.  Alternatively, the first few sentence from the main content will be used."
msgstr "Sa a pral kontni prensipal la nan nouvo kontni sit ou. Rezime a ka itilize pou montre yon deskripsyon kout kout kontni ou. Pli lwen, rezime a pral parèt nan lis ak opinyon kat nan dosye ou sou sit entènèt la. Altènativman, yo pral premye fraz la kèk soti nan kontni prensipal la dwe itilize."

#: js/bioland.help-comments.js
msgid "Images"
msgstr "Imaj"

#: js/bioland.help-comments.js
msgid "The <b>first image</b> in order of left to right here, <b>will be the main image</b> of your record displayed on the page and in thumbnails in list and card views.  All another images will be displayed below the main content."
msgstr "Pre <b>mye im</b> aj la nan lòd de bò gòch a dwa isit <b>la, yo pral imaj prensipal</b> la nan dosye ou parèt sou paj la ak nan thumbnails nan lis ak opinyon kat. Tout yon lòt imaj yo pral parèt anba a kontni prensipal la."

